# A331460

Irregular triangle read by rows in which row n is the result of iterating the operation f(n) = n/7 if n == 0 (mod 7), otherwise f(n) = 7*(n + ceiling(n/7)), terminating at the first occurrence of 1.

The 71 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

